{"id":862284,"title":"11｜如何快速达成DeepSeek R1与Agent的结合？（上）","content":"本文介绍了如何将DeepSeek R1与Agent整合，以实现更智能的任务处理。首先解释了Agent的概念，即人工智能体或AI代理，它能自主感知环境、做出决策并实现特定目标，模拟人的认知过程。接着讨论了构成智能体的四个关键要素：代理人模型、短期和长期记忆、规划能力以及工具调用功能。尽管DeepSeek R1本身具备强大的思考能力和接受提示词的能力，但其官方版本不支持函数调用（Function Call），无法直接调用外部工具。然而，通过使用Coze平台，可以赋予R1这一缺失的功能，从而构建一个能够调用搜索引擎等工具、具有记忆力且能自我反思的人工智能体。具体实现过程中，通过预设角色和技能，并利用插件系统来扩展R1的功能，如热点搜索和文章生成。最终，展示了如何结合Coze和DeepSeek R1创建一个简单的AI Agent，该Agent不仅能够调用工具，还能进行自我反思，提高任务处理效率。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":399117,"user_name":"kxydoublek","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1214264,"ip_address":"安徽","ucode":"9FA6D0AE763AE9","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/87/38/680b20bb.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1743152811,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101000501,"comment_content":"快快更新呀","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":399015,"user_name":"小圣","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1076531,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"0D156CE4CF8029","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/6d/33/2ea1134b.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1742909166,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101000501,"comment_content":"请问一下课程中老师说的ppt在哪里下载？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":399010,"user_name":"聪少 Jeff","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1159983,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"C791ACA9B47679","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/b3/2f/d08a1363.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1742901273,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101000501,"comment_content":"请问课程的PPT在哪里？","like_count":0}]}